$$
W
  ====
  - [[Page~145 却(8)卻(8)]]
    ==
    - To stop;
    - to curb desires, to refuse, to deny, to decline doing or accepting;
    - to retire, to go backwards;
    - to look up;
    - a particle used to strengthen an assertion,
      certainly, really, truly---and often needs no translation;
    - _k(')(e/)uk(8) hai(6)_
        [[koek3 hai6]]
        evidently;
    - _k(')(e/)uk(8) yau(6) (4)loi_
        [[koek3 jau6 loi4]],
        come again, eh! behold, again!
    - _(4)mong k(')(e/)uk(8)_
        [[mong4 koek3]]
        I forgot it;
    - _k(')(e/)uk(8) (5)y(a/)_
        [[koek3 jaa5]],
        preceded by _(1)sui_ [[seoi1]], is a disjunctive phrase,
        but that, still, nor, yet therefore, although---yet;
    - an interrogative word, as
      _k(')(e/)uk(8) sh(i/)(6) wai(6) (4)ho_
        [[koek3 si6 wai6 ho4]],
        but why so, pray?
    - then, therefore;
    - _k(')(e/)uk(8) sh(u:)t(8)_
        [[koek3 syut3]]
        turn now to speak of, it is said;
    - _(4)n(a/)n k(')(e/)uk(8)_
        [[naan4 koek3]]
        not easy to decline it;
    - _(5)li(u/) k(')(e/)uk(8)_
        [[liu5 koek3]]
        to disdain, to complete and put away;
    - _k(')(e/)uk(8) (4)hang_
        [[koek3 hang4]],
        to walk backwards, to go away;
    - _(1)t(')(u/)i k(')(e/)uk(8)_
        [[teoi1 koek3]]
        to decline, to put off with excuses.
    ==
  ====
